# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo tracks CRM *functionality* only — Obsidian plugin config, the
# QuickAdd templates + scripts, and the Dashboard. The actual CRM data and
# notes (Companies, People, Service Requests, Meetings, Notes, Sales, images)
# are deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the vault root, then re-include the parts
# that are needed to reconstruct the setup on a fresh machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# 2. ...then re-include the functionality bits.
!/.gitignore
!/.obsidian/
!/Templates/
!/Scripts/
!/Runbooks/
!/Dashboard.md
!/CRM Automations.md
!/CRM Design Recommendation.md

# 3. Runbooks/ holds mostly client notes — keep only the reusable template.
/Runbooks/*
!/Runbooks/Runbook Template.md

# 4. Inside .obsidian/: keep the JSON config, drop the bulky vendored plugin
#    code (re-installed from the community store) and per-machine UI state.
/.obsidian/plugins/*/main.js
/.obsidian/plugins/*/styles.css
/.obsidian/workspace.json
/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
/.obsidian/**/*.bak

# 5. Local Claude Code state (machine-specific).
/.claude/
